 "turns": {
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC01-S003": [
   ["I'm very well, thank you.","とても元気です、ありがとうございます。","8ad1f873-c23a-4368-a3c6-1dcb8f6b38aa","7abe851a-d8f6-443e-b2db-134d39c5e97e"],
   ["Are you going to work?","お仕事に行くんですか。","a9546bc7-a407-47d7-9486-9542dde763d5","fa144d14-daf1-457d-a774-c7ab09b2d640"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC01-S004": [
   ["Yes, I've got a busy day today.","ええ、今日は忙しい一日になりそうです。","f70cfb0c-91ac-41d0-881d-36a09ed4c504","28fcd245-da18-4575-801a-26180f53e663"],
   ["I hope you have a good day.","良い一日をお過ごしください。","332471c3-df1c-48e8-b8db-70677e75e257","b7878266-ee62-49fc-9d69-ca6605de8762"],
   ["See you later.","またあとで。","d6ad2b21-67c0-487e-af21-2a1539d27873","cb72a790-94cd-412d-bc1d-5ac37d4d37f2"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC02-S002": [
   ["No, it's free.","いいえ、空いていますよ。","b32b39c0-c46c-4048-9da7-b8d3414e8d33","030b8c3b-5a5d-4bbb-adf8-2f0b27df48e9"],
   ["Please, go ahead.","どうぞ、お先に。","3b9cdcdc-a1d5-441c-a97c-bb85ddd7a900","dcc6a042-2bbc-4cfe-b789-715703fce96b"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC02-S005": [
   ["It's not very far.","あまり遠くないですよ。","677f4245-cdcf-42b8-8d89-4382becef57f","db399107-9609-4029-95bb-630963f4cfce"],
   ["Maybe three or four miles.","三、四マイルくらいです。","85cf5235-4b41-4498-914b-41ad541da977","a114fd22-b3be-4190-bf7c-003597108373"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC03-S002": [
   ["Good afternoon.","こんにちは。","5672a478-df69-4b0b-82da-fa66d7f99487","e13688e4-4613-4388-bfed-6253fbad4055"],
   ["I'd like a coffee, please.","コーヒーをください。","b11b5f07-920c-445b-aa01-9302999b690b","76f23832-9bb0-436c-beed-a13c6b85f5ef"],
   ["With milk but with no sugar.","ミルクありで、砂糖なしで。","e5353a0b-4058-409f-87e6-4b3f6d2fb90b","3ec79e5c-b94c-4891-b6c9-37aa2976fd3e"],
   ["To take away.","お持ち帰りで。","4fcc1b95-be7a-4159-a323-5112161f5a68","b8ace906-ee6c-4063-b8cf-75f53e70dc46"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC04-S002": [
   ["Hello! I'm sorry","こんにちは！すみませんが、","40682ea8-7551-42b4-ba40-5c006c787240","60033a96-f31f-4382-bacc-ff5a24a0c2de"],
   ["but I can't talk at the moment.","今は話せないんです。","1e49ae04-132b-4054-83a8-431330670bc4","6321aeb0-3cfb-4d7b-8240-12c245e6c797"],
   ["I need to go home now.","もう家に帰らないといけなくて。","718ad06e-0398-4a5b-a2e1-d0ef877d7632","6bc634a5-3e31-4646-acda-98e989c2590b"],
   ["Shall we go for a coffee tomorrow?","明日コーヒーでも飲みに行きませんか？","7cc52f6e-0a9d-4959-94d8-9049d59b45b9","321cef8e-1d87-4c39-9dea-9b682edd1420"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC04-S003": [
   ["No, I'm sorry,","いいえ、すみません、","d6137452-9e33-4d7d-a215-e5832cba0101","43e0912a-8a52-41fb-86fb-3e97b1bd2ea4"],
   ["I'm busy tomorrow.","明日は忙しいんです。","1db99934-9db5-4710-8fbe-d31f319e1bf2","c7087d50-b49d-4379-b1e7-07609e85ec85"],
   ["But let's go on Saturday.","でも土曜日に行きましょう。","db48400a-b8ea-4ebf-8e16-713a5896980c","82a1d8ba-0ee2-4803-979f-8f6dc209fb03"],
   ["See you then.","それではまた。","2a201dc1-3dc5-4bcb-9488-73e6229991b3","3d2163fe-c68c-440d-92df-77468eb7d22c"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC05-S001": [
   ["Good evening, Sarah.","こんばんは、サラさん。","263540f9-1215-4fc2-86fc-947064cbcb77","99396522-0b7c-45e3-bc6c-4c469813d9bd"],
   ["Did you have a long day?","今日は長い一日でしたか。","771b5ae4-458c-40f5-95f9-ff6b5f062abd","2185c7b2-1239-4d39-94e2-5b63fa869665"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC05-S002": [
   ["Yes, very.","はい、とても。","2cf83d1d-62e5-4fea-b75e-304d80a639b9","536f42cf-b23a-4603-b96e-784cbc697a53"],
   ["I'm very tired now.","今はとても疲れています。","ea9594da-d97e-4ac8-9542-3d32f4e04e5b","95c035b3-33d9-4bcc-827e-be0157ddd864"],
   ["Good night. See you tomorrow.","おやすみなさい。また明日。","e41cfe74-313e-4555-b956-c4307c2d31b1","f09815a2-ac19-4d05-988c-f1e5e4a32f69"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC06-S001": [
   ["Excuse me. Hello.","すみません。こんにちは。","ac76d781-4247-41f8-8d6d-c0c9d6207444","b638ebd8-4e34-46b2-bad6-ea1f6cd240eb"],
   ["What's your name?","お名前は何ですか？","6a66b16e-bfdd-43c6-9605-2478d61c1b73","5d43a1f2-33c9-4f60-ab51-408c93704d55"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC06-S004": [
   ["Pleased to meet you too.","こちらこそ、はじめまして。","a81577b1-71c7-4108-a335-0c222c06613c","b4900627-17bd-4814-8adc-dd68293ed876"],
   ["Where are you from?","どちらのご出身ですか？","7a0adaed-21b6-4093-807b-5250f37db836","dfd5c0b7-c7c9-48db-8715-e007a70730ae"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC06-S005": [
   ["I'm from Manchester,","マンチェスター出身ですが、","418d8eb6-3e4b-4692-8ea8-94bfb303ca93","99cbfc0d-10f4-4c5d-ae23-a16ae536056a"],
   ["but I live in London now.","今はロンドンに住んでいます。","08f542a6-076d-45ab-b296-37bee7e43bbd","d0909d71-6f2a-4114-a9d8-6383b211fe16"],
   ["And you?","あなたは？","47adfedf-23ff-4a4a-b14c-86980983c5dd","4c176da1-1372-4d69-b71d-8a1d9eb49a00"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC06-S006": [
   ["I'm from France.","フランス出身です。","c1f5022e-c869-49b9-b632-2f2ae3bdf468","2aa3b74c-c1df-417b-92c2-50ce8629d5a4"],
   ["I've been here for two years.","ここに来て二年になります。","6787458b-7bf7-438a-9a06-f25d960191db","1817599c-5921-44d7-bec6-aee2d2388f97"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC06-S007": [
   ["This is a lovely city.","素敵な街ですね。","84e32b38-90dc-4e34-8540-165fbbb796a3","a0cb0476-2376-412a-85ab-2dfaf1675021"],
   ["What do you do?","お仕事は何をされていますか？","3bad72fb-037d-4bca-a36d-1e9ae84636f1","9dcea7dd-46d9-4b55-ac48-bdc6e4b1af1b"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC06-S008": [
   ["I'm a nurse,","私は看護師です。","66c08773-855e-494b-9132-96d779bdbf52","b8ace993-9f00-4211-a601-4428a77c93a7"],
   ["at the hospital just round the corner.","すぐそこの角を曲がったところにある病院で働いています。","224157b8-3cb9-4f16-ab38-eee9ea81cbef","c96ca9bc-0f16-4ee7-a5c3-851abc9a67e9"],
   ["And you?","あなたは？","80bf9401-7106-4e8d-809e-bb7c5138ca94","12d65a5c-5c61-44b2-b11b-fe882a19320e"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC06-S009": [
   ["I'm sorry, I didn't understand you.","すみません、おっしゃっていることがわかりませんでした。","c6a14ba4-ca0f-44a3-ba37-e975dab3d059","f1158a91-f7b9-4acf-af8b-320197432782"],
   ["I'm learning English.","英語を勉強しています。","479eb65d-a12c-462b-bb49-226afa45f3b9","d4096160-84d3-4fbb-b555-9cb32709a05a"],
   ["Could you say that again more slowly?","もう少しゆっくり言っていただけますか？","67119034-b97b-4811-9128-c5355ba0ac7d","a5266d9b-7a94-4fe3-b261-cbd92342dd10"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC06-S010": [
   ["Yes, of course.","はい、もちろんです。","71191dc5-a48e-4f9e-9260-c33fb1e0aa7c","3afb27e0-1b3c-46cc-bbb2-392889af7472"],
   ["I'm a nurse.","私は看護師です。","610572b5-a5b9-4eb1-9298-f44cc48b4519","b8ace993-9f00-4211-a601-4428a77c93a7"],
   ["I work at the hospital.","病院で働いています。","715e7c47-aea4-4d7a-8252-6c446cde24f1","f3760ecd-a26b-4933-a78a-e80c91635b1f"],
   ["It's near here.","ここの近くです。","30631d28-b46c-4db3-bbb0-b5a3ced8a424","0156c454-c71f-4340-8433-c6ca39918227"],
   ["And what do you do?","あなたは何をされていますか？","6361ca2d-28b1-4b8d-a3d2-1db37c3e3668","b60d90d9-100e-49b8-a146-e80eeab03cec"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC06-S011": [
   ["I teach English,","英語を教えています。","10c384bf-d0f1-4dbd-9b76-a641a87a959f","19ef2b16-03ad-425a-a873-3373419e2248"],
   ["but not in a school.","でも学校ではなく、","aa43a14a-f6e5-4a6d-9748-7fcd4994ad87","93ed7a9d-b181-4b4a-9773-2a2b50c8e16a"],
   ["I work with adults.","大人の方を対象にしています。","6270873e-d31c-45b1-8534-ab9f76c76d69","4cc80020-22e1-4ce0-be55-b8d9173d7e02"],
   ["I'm on holiday here with my wife and children.","今は妻と子どもたちと一緒にここで休暇を過ごしています。","d21e5d02-75da-4d23-8dc7-88e4badb09de","56c6e7e1-0313-4f41-abd8-a0ffd825d409"],
   ["We're having a lovely time.","とても楽しい時間を過ごしています。","d6054fa9-7385-427d-9782-aeac749fd6ef","694b9221-d9bd-42ab-a671-1538b7047941"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC06-S012": [
   ["How interesting.","それは面白いですね。","14abfccf-c3b1-4b01-a88a-3634bef297a6","00fa6d21-06da-4bc6-830d-4f06df386d5f"],
   ["Well, lovely to meet you.","では、お会いできてよかったです。","3a84e55a-3285-4905-9a41-2c28dd034d1a","e6f81d2d-3619-4534-bd3f-e036e3b72d2e"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC07-S004": [
