   ["With oat milk if you have it.","オーツミルクがあれば、それで。","87b8e0d7-f65e-4cac-98f9-a4352018d3b6","934c1457-bb2a-4c08-9301-bbbea18b443f"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC07-S005": [
   ["Of course.","もちろんです。","5f70ef56-5789-4f66-b9cd-99044d24e5a4","d99536f7-919e-4d3b-b62a-7f432059a445"],
   ["Would you like to sit-in or takeaway?","こちらでお召し上がりですか、それともお持ち帰りですか？","0fb6adf3-fba5-4c5e-98c4-fc4729258c72","0cc9e612-b67a-406e-9ea2-a2f796bee8a8"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC07-S011": [
   ["Could I pay by card?","カードで払えますか？","c886fa73-2c05-45b6-81c5-257cf7d6dd97","ab83a579-58b9-42c0-8414-4224dc4ea032"],
   ["Do you have contactless?","タッチ決済はできますか？","7e02ffd0-6643-4a27-ab1b-1a392cd56f8a","39d15c71-89c1-420f-8032-2fb41ac8623d"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC07-S012": [
   ["Of course.","もちろんです。","5f70ef56-5789-4f66-b9cd-99044d24e5a4","d99536f7-919e-4d3b-b62a-7f432059a445"],
   ["There's the machine.","こちらの機械をどうぞ。","71306062-1e1b-4a61-a543-871661ebdd27","66ff9c9d-b010-4b15-a7ab-6936e0089449"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC07-S013": [
   ["Good morning.","おはようございます。","c9b37a99-ce37-4327-afe7-36ed88f6f980","6636ef45-ca3c-43a1-8665-a38fc481c3a7"],
   ["Two Americanos and a cup of tea, please.","アメリカーノをふたつと紅茶をひとつください。","a3c73b91-d682-45ee-9a7e-0bf31a1e7bd2","43c2cbee-fd86-40b8-88bc-11b0182a7d23"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC07-S014": [
   ["Would you like to sit-in?","こちらでお召し上がりですか？","9f9a6b06-adbb-4903-b3ab-5e3cb7a822ca","a7794148-daf3-4f54-ab9d-751951529368"],
   ["The table by the window is free.","窓際のテーブルが空いております。","cbbba47f-d618-4685-967d-201bbb6e5b58","ea29557e-7899-452f-867d-71f3d865f76a"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC08-S002": [
   ["I'd like a pint, please.","パイントをお願いします。","1d5d057f-04eb-4892-9cea-5918d3d74adb","4f73a137-2c6a-473f-a9aa-81f757a6da80"],
   ["What ales do you have on?","エールは何がありますか。","09991a0e-128a-4d39-93d6-4cc3dcd4b1c7","892cf965-da78-4b57-9963-86c5efbeb6c6"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC08-S003": [
   ["We've got a bitter and a stout,","ビターとスタウトがあって、","093f8a2b-c4eb-4bdd-9e61-47221c00e97b","bf60c8e2-8479-4435-b840-eb9b51ad485d"],
   ["and they're both local.","どちらも地元のものです。","ceb53cc2-0ea3-4f77-80f6-d6fa308291a8","4d1d92a6-eddd-4a1c-a11f-ea63b822a95f"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC08-S006": [
   ["Could I see the wine list?","ワインリストを見せていただけますか？","16f2ef9f-6bb6-4173-9514-c7a99631208b","f01bc966-be08-462f-93e7-93c4f1135fea"],
   ["I want a glass of wine.","ワインをグラスで飲みたいんです。","540cfa40-68d6-494c-ad3c-7b5cb9554312","4613bcab-c56b-478e-a635-76b2101837ad"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC08-S012": [
   ["I'm not sure if I'm hungry.","お腹が空いているかわからないんです。","382e6dba-cd76-41f7-b3a2-1c01cce9f16a","0c9e6dae-773d-43d5-b847-6983e206f36e"],
   ["Do you have a menu?","メニューはありますか？","77a124a2-8160-4ebc-8ade-330b5180b3d6","91201703-492d-4a36-83b8-b82b69c879a1"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC08-S013": [
   ["Yes, of course. Here it is.","はい、もちろんです。こちらどうぞ。","78135242-f24c-4d9f-9168-8827fa9ee451","13f1f2fd-bae6-4e92-83b1-763e5017598b"],
   ["The fish and chips are very good.","フィッシュアンドチップスがとてもおいしいですよ。","d8772164-5c67-47d0-9fdc-e89345ac8cee","8520bbad-0fd4-4f7f-8d11-b328e342a954"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC08-S014": [
   ["Can we have some bread?","パンをいただけますか？","68cdc3f2-afc9-449d-9ae8-c904a300a747","6e12a98c-af18-4a04-a16c-5fec758944d3"],
   ["And a bowl of chips for the table.","それとテーブル用にチップスをひと皿お願いします。","92e72a43-ed5e-4f36-a859-006d717c98b2","e1868a7c-76ac-40d4-a659-cbfc588c9ed8"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC08-S015": [
   ["Do you have any sandwiches?","サンドイッチはありますか？","7121aaa5-636b-435b-9911-60e1746e33d2","48f1d776-6c1d-4cb4-b4b4-95b113a15d37"],
   ["I'd like a cheese sandwich, please.","チーズサンドイッチをひとつください。","b4e7e7cb-fb20-4088-b6e6-aad42583d783","468a7499-aceb-4074-a2fd-7c5612c728cd"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC09-S001": [
   ["Good evening.","こんばんは。","76dd9bbd-5980-493e-9360-22221ac101e4","56dfd39c-3454-4641-b595-40234261a81c"],
   ["We have a booking for two, under the name Davies.","デイヴィス名義で、二名の予約をしております。","00873548-384e-46f8-97dd-8d1c43e9f50f","6a3e2c21-3ab5-4a0c-9658-804aa74435b8"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC09-S002": [
   ["Welcome.","いらっしゃいませ。","2f517446-dfdc-4ad0-becf-58e6c51ca587","5d891fb0-1749-4e56-82d0-4e806359aa89"],
   ["Please follow me.","こちらへどうぞ。","bc2a0714-1e86-4743-9dc2-795d0a33ac50","627cc652-cdd3-4957-a520-84c4702a2899"],
   ["Here are the menus.","メニューでございます。","111dc3e0-b7e3-45cc-9c1b-8da191cf59b7","61998795-3e14-4753-9db4-eadd5be0bbba"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC09-S006": [
   ["Yes, the salmon and the risotto are both gluten-free.","はい、サーモンとリゾットはどちらもグルテンフリーでございます。","cb4587ae-7ffe-41c5-8ff4-38a466e7f573","a6b94de2-4943-44eb-b98d-06a17c865244"],
   ["We also have some salads.","サラダもいくつかご用意しております。","eaa2ea0d-7f78-49a3-9d5c-8bb643568ce2","667e142a-9217-4def-bc52-a3930389635a"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC09-S008": [
   ["The lamb is excellent.","ラムが大変おすすめでございます。","47f95686-b1e2-4b48-83ae-5fb7e353f2ac","a914ca23-e36d-4d5e-a847-c9d23555f632"],
   ["It's been slow-cooked, with rosemary.","ローズマリーと一緒に、じっくりと煮込んでおります。","4c7ee99d-d373-449b-af3b-8753c5c96d53","39c22cd0-e504-4d5b-9e14-b3d01a0e885e"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC09-S009": [
   ["I'll have the lamb, please.","では、ラムをお願いします。","dc38313c-b001-41cb-95ef-67bdaa49b7c9","6e5b96ae-3b26-4587-81c7-453b0d117e79"],
   ["With a side of greens.","付け合わせに青野菜もつけてください。","bd3ce971-b135-4254-bf65-c876b6672b0b","7cd7bb82-f169-40d7-972e-e8abe2b18ab3"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC09-S010": [
   ["And the risotto for me.","私はリゾットをお願いします。","0ab13c8c-60dc-46a1-a2e0-05939a8a206e","42e24b16-1430-42b4-8e9e-fdba79a70237"],
   ["With a small green salad to start.","最初に、小さめのグリーンサラダもお願いします。","70fb684a-eed0-4494-ae67-5e3693ac68d1","a7e03c8c-c34d-462e-b19f-d7dcaa79a812"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC09-S011": [
   ["Of course.","かしこまりました。","73e1ade0-040c-4d28-a285-138a727f1253","fde7087f-2ff2-4618-974a-77d6ce0d3a50"],
   ["And what would you like to drink?","お飲み物はいかがなさいますか？","fda6d28c-2fff-436f-8ff7-2216faa48f38","cdd1f1e8-ba0e-437b-a628-ff7907be3f15"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC09-S015": [
   ["Is everything alright?","お料理のお味はいかがでしたか？","23266310-e53f-4e74-bb89-2a6e5edda66b","a298ca8a-6472-41bb-89fa-dd2b8851f499"],
   ["Do you have any room for dessert?","デザートはいかがですか？","df370956-ad47-4c90-90e2-96f3720ad1b3","80dd7258-c946-467d-82a1-da15240de5a6"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC09-S016": [
   ["Just two coffees, please.","コーヒーを二つだけお願いします。","1b4795de-9cab-44ac-bf10-bdf2871e639c","ef0aa122-5039-432c-91a8-deca5a58afb7"],
   ["Decaf for me.","私のはデカフェで。","c1dc2e72-fda3-49bd-8ea0-a1cf6d02e0ee","df6ef905-f3d4-48cf-9edf-660038d1702d"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC09-S017": [
   ["And the bill, when you're ready.","準備ができましたら、お会計もお願いします。","2e348068-1608-4110-be5b-fc7b194533dc","4df6a550-4069-4f2c-830d-bf6695b5a9dd"],
   ["Could we split it?","割り勘にできますか？","7876bf13-7cb4-4435-a8c2-195200bded48","7f34e92d-465c-4191-8082-a453d8be8a0b"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC10-S001": [
   ["Excuse me.","すみません。","4d35ce53-4b8e-465f-b7a9-b95426abe3f8","f9b76048-1c66-4b68-8962-05a93ddc90f3"],
   ["Do you have any painkillers?","痛み止めはありますか？","ef9a5855-5c1c-410b-bdcf-ab14fb36c925","86212bea-497f-4bb3-819d-79667464762b"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC10-S003": [
   ["Thank you.","ありがとうございます。","e8c75798-5ad0-47f4-926d-48a88505f3d8","2e1b5341-5afd-4c33-a3fd-6fcfb4e66036"],
   ["And do you have any painkillers for children?","子ども用の痛み止めはありますか？","92a7c00c-c8e9-447d-b822-048ead6c3a43","8f848e38-9528-4e9d-81d6-ab9d79b5b86a"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC10-S004": [
   ["I think so,","あると思いますが、","083c1b13-324a-46db-9451-ad584921519f","54be0b15-971c-4ceb-b7d7-a5ee55c4b3a5"],
   ["but you'll have to look to make sure.","確認のためにご覧いただく必要があります。","82613111-5337-40a3-ab31-a9c5c8584196","dfd9401f-b3f9-4a8f-ac21-7dfecc566a17"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC10-S006": [
   ["Sunscreen is down there on your right,","日焼け止めはあちらの右側にあります。","f3d54e12-858b-4a6a-86ea-2911127e1cb1","af31227a-46c1-48a5-b883-f852f3915275"],
   ["and you'll find toothpaste just round the corner.","歯磨き粉は角を曲がったところにございます。","e6b8c96d-d7c9-48e1-8e08-d816b98d60e2","fabc3d56-09d9-4966-8b58-fd0b6ace8ebf"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC10-S008": [
   ["You're welcome.","いいえ、どういたしまして。","5d55041c-5685-48c7-9859-fde2677a459f","058ab1fe-c591-4ca9-ae8d-75a01478ca19"],
   ["Are you here on holiday?","観光でいらっしゃっているんですか？","909170cd-510c-4d58-8f30-89233fe84c43","78e13532-420f-4928-ba72-884a25c07313"],
   ["You speak very good English.","英語がとてもお上手ですね。","d930f751-8149-409f-995b-67eb885cda2c","26ce0b43-7cdf-4077-a31e-d5ab45dac192"]
  ],
  "eng_for_jpn:pod-1:SC10-S009": [
   ["That's very kind of you!","ご親切にどうもありがとうございます!","c2c7822d-85f6-4eea-9869-edd3f40db30f","26414be5-b73f-4719-a7a1-4fc318dd0290"],
   ["Yes, I'm on holiday,","はい、休暇で来ていて、","de432528-dcca-4ce7-83d7-9b34da210201","16c7b24a-00ea-43b4-a3f8-9fc0a3ee87a2"],
   ["and I need to practice more to speak English better.","英語をもっと上手に話せるように練習が必要なんです。","79020d4b-c54c-44ba-a30e-8db0412dc309","92e24bcc-b37c-45d0-9ca7-47a06ad95e9b"],
   ["Thank you very much, and goodbye.","どうもありがとうございました、それでは失礼します。","9dbc5c36-be61-49de-91f1-b5901009c321","d2337509-3f7e-4ba0-9bd6-02792f160a93"]
  ]
